WEBVTT

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.740
I have returned.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:20.240
Welcome home, milady. Your tea is ready.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.460
Thank you.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.300
Did something happen?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.920
That thing has begun to take action.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.380
Are you referring to the Takamagahara?

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.680
Yes.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.350
Terumi as well.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.390
If Terumi has insinuated himself into matters,

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:47.190
a number of troublesome situations are bound to occur.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.770
How inconvenient.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:54.110
Is that truly how you feel, milady?

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.610
Oh? Why do you ask?

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.580
Because you smiled.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.290
You are mistaken.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:05.290
I was merely sighing.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.880
Please forgive my presumptuousness.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:16.010
Amidst eternal time that had lost even its meaning,

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:21.560
the world had been about to fall into a slumber within a labyrinth with no exit.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.850
But then came a knock.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:29.310
Repeated time began to move

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:33.690
and the probabilistic event had been set in motion.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:34.900
Yes.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:40.320
What do you have planned next?

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:43.450
I am an observer.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:48.250
All I do is witness and sigh in admiration.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.670
Understood.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:58.300
Then I shall exist solely to moisten the lips of that beautiful beginning.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:37.690
Rebel 5: The Pair of White Guns

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.440
Kokonoe here. Come in, Tager.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.990
This is Tager.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:47.490
I'm currently in the air about 2000 from Kagutsuchi's protective zone.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.250
Really, now? You're almost there already. That was fast.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.000
I'm still waiting to be briefed.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.210
Hazama and Relius landed in Kagutsuchi.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.340
What? This can't mean good news.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.380
What's their objective?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.390
Prolly the Azure Successor, Noel Vermillion.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:09.180
And that's why I want you to take her into custody first.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.480
Into custody? Is that really necessary?

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.850
Yeah, it's goddamn stupid,

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.480
but those decrepit old geezers at Sector Sever

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:22.400
are bickering about how to deal with Noel Vermillion and Ragna the Bloodedge.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.570
That so?

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:29.540
They talk big about not letting the NOL getting away with shit and controlling the use of ars magus,

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.120
but it's not as if Sector Seven's a monolithic entity.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.830
We're trying to change the world with science,

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.080
but they still haven't analyzed or evaluating a goddamn thing yet.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.790
They still have no clue what the frickin' Eye does,

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.840
and they're still blabbering about how the blasted Azure Grimoire is oh-so-important!

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:43.510
They're frickin' children!

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.390
I'm gonna beat our own Sector agent to the punch

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.770
to say nothing of those useless NOL bastards, and get my hands on Noel Vermillion first!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.100
Roger that.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:56.350
On that topic, what should we do regarding the Azure Grimoire.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.400
Huh? Oh, you mean Ragna the Bloodedge?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.530
Don't waste your time. It's the weakest of the Grimoires.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.570
This has been bothering me for a while, but why do you say it's the weakest?

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:12.040
For all the praise it gets as being the most powerful, it has a fatal flaw.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.120
Nobody's gonna be scared about "the most powerful" anything once its weakness is revealed, right?

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.620
True.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.550
Let me confirm the details of the mission one last time.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.260
The top priority is to take Noel Vermillion into custody—

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.010
Piece of shit radio's starting to break down.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.510
Kokonoe.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:33.930
Approaching point of descent.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.600
Roger that.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:40.060
TR-0009 Tager, commencing assault.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.990
Bon appetit!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.710
Noel, you're part of the NOL.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:06.420
Is it okay for you to stay by Ragna the Bloodedge's side for this long?

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:08.380
I know...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:13.060
But I still have so many things I need to ask him.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.390
Boobie Lady, gimme meowre!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.390
All right, fine.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.940
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:19.980
Here you go.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.480
Purrfect!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.610
I'll pretend to eat it and then—

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.440
Shazam! Give it to Good Guy!

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.410
It burns! You got mush for brains or something, cat?!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:31.700
Salute!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.620
I swear to God...

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.580
Are you all better meow, Good Guy?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.880
No, he hasn't fully recovered yet.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.210
We should go out then!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:47.300
The Kaka Clan has a miraclaw cure that's been seclawtly passed down the generations.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.970
Just by going there, you'll be healed of any physiclaw or emeowtional wounds!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:52.550
Huh?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.390
Tao, I told you to stop going on about—

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.770
If we go, Good Guy will be all better in meow time at all!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.230
R-Really?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.310
It's not nice to joke about this kind of stuff, Tao.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.690
I've been around the Kaka village for many years,

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.900
but I've never once heard of a secret remedy.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:12.740
Why the heck would we tell our secrets to Boobie Lady?

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.160
What?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:17.080
It's a super clawssified kind of secret, that's why!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.080
You sure talk a lot about it a lot for something that's supposed to be secret!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.540
Afterwards, I'll strongly stimulate the backs of your heads

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.710
and make furget about it all!

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.050
Hey, back the bus up! I'm not so sure I need or want to go to that kind of place.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.340
We should go!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.590
Huh?!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.380
I'm good. Too much of a pain, anyway.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.390
Don't you want to get better?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:36.350
If they have such a powerful cure, you should use it!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:40.140
Um, are you really taking Tao's story on faith?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.190
Huh? But it's true, right?

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.230
Of claws it's true!

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.310
She says it is!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.110
What makes you think you can just take her word for it?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:55.070
It's a spurrkly, meowlty, wonderfur kinda miraclaw cure!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.030
Good Guy's gonna be up in a flash.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.080
No way I'm going there!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.830
It sounds incredibly potent!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.250
Oh, Noel!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:02.620
What?

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.040
Tao isn't exactly the most...

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:04.790
Tao.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.790
Rabbit Lady, you're back!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:10.710
How was your walk? Find any snacky-snacks?

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:14.550
Envision this place that you say has this cure.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:15.430
What, what?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.100
Uh...

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.360
Um, where are we?

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.360
The Kaka Hot Springs, the secluded hot spring of the Kaka Clan!

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.200
A hot spring?

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.820
Frickin' Rabbit! You can't teleport us out of the blue like th—

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.700
Taokaka Change!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:45.420
Meow!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.330
Wh-Wh-What's with this getup?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.090
The Kaka Hot Spring is coed, so you hafta wear swimsuits!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.170
Hey, Tao...

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.880
Taokaka Hip Attack!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.810
What was that for?!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.850
They say that the cowardly dog howls at everything.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.020
Ragna,

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:10.110
you've been howling so much, it's starting to make <i>me</i> embarrassed.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.320
Okay?

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:15.610
With heated thinking, even achievable endeavors will end in failure.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.160
Cool off your head.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:23.370
Forget cooling off. He'll end up with a heat stroke in here.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.750
But he'll be all better afterwards!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:29.420
After all, this is where the Princess came to heal that stupid ol—

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.090
Oh, dear.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.930
Why, you!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.270
What's with that look, Rabbit? That time of the month?

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:46.350
This is way too embarrassing!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.100
Give me back my clothes!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.270
You look good in that, Noel.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.110
I do? B-But...

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.320
I wasn't too excited about this at first, but we've come this far already.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.280
Let's relax a bit and enjoy our time here.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.280
You think so?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.450
But...

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.250
We can make a special exception and you can go in your birthday suit!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.960
What a pain in the ass.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.340
But you prefer those kinds of girls, don't you?

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.210
I what?

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:20.340
You are always surrounded by imbecilic and childish girls just like her.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.560
Well, I guess that's true.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.060
Oh, but still...

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:33.230
Th-This swimsuit is way too revealing to be worn around a guy!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.490
Will this suffice, then?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.200
Well done. That should ease your mind.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.620
'Ere we go!

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:49.080
H-Hey!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.170
I swallowed some of the water!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.000
No problemeow.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.630
The Kaka Hot Spring is 120% Kagutsuchi catnip!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.840
Drink it or soak in it, it's a delicious ingredient that'll fill you up with energy!

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:03.050
It'll make anybody content as a cat!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.140
Content?

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:05.180
Oh...

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.390
Ms. Litchi, are you okay?

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.140
Meow?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:16.570
Call my name and I'll appear! Lovely Lass Litchi is here!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.280
Wow... I guess she looks content...

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:25.620
Today, I'm drinking as much as I can!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.580
Ladies, drink up. You too, Noel.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.210
Here you go!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:38.840
Hey, it's not bad!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.800
Isn't it?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.970
Delicious!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.350
Meow!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.180
Things are starting to liven up here!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.850
Come on, Good Guy! Join in!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:56.150
Hold on! I can't see shit here!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.570
Oh, I'm done.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.990
Oh no, you don't!

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.990
P-Please let me go!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:05.910
Get the hell off me!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:16.920
I swear...

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.210
You're free to do as you please after this.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.420
Huh?

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.260
All right! I'll do as I please!

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.350
Target acquired, Noel!
No! You're such a bad drunk!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.430
What was that?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.270
What the heck?!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.360
The fuck?!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.460
You sure about this?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.250
Those losers were being hella loud and obnoxious.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.630
That was precisely how the Princess wanted it.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.090
Why?!

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:11.220
Ragna the Bloodedge's and Noel Vermillion's Azure

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.930
have begun to interfere with one another.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:14.890
Indeed.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.110
All is going according to plan, milady.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.190
I hope you are correct.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.160
Jesus, that was the pits!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.000
Where do you suppose Ms. Litchi and Taokaka have gone?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:43.130
I don't give a crap. For now, we're going back to the Kaka village.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.710
The seithr around here is thick.

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:50.890
Taokaka?

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.400
Here we go...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.730
Please leave this to me.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.030
Bolverk!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.590
Why...

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.340
Mr. Ragna!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.550
Um, Mr. Ragna...

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.890
Girl, do you know what those are?!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:47.190
The two Azures will be drawn to one another and at the same time...

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.530
...repel each other.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:57.790
Are you waiting in anticipation of the possibility that will be born as a result of that, milady?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.330
I am.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.670
The possibility that will shape the future is hope...

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.550
...as well as despair.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:07.630
However,

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.180
You musn't hesitate to evolve.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.350
If you forever remain foolish and weak,

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:19.520
you will end up crushed by the weight of the world.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:26.480
<i>She's got the same face as Saya, and wields a Nox Nyctores...</i>

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.950
<i>Is she... a Prime Field?</i>

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.700
Mr. Ragna?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.090
Mr. Rag—

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:49.300
I don't want to hear that name from someone wearing that face!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.020
I am an observer.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.070
I merely observe, sigh in admiration,

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.820
and set ripples in motion.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:15.780
My sole hope is that those ripples will serve to propel those living in this world to move forward.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.920
Do you wish to live?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:36.890
I see.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:46.980
Ragna...

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.820
Ragna the Bloodedge.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.250
The Azure Grimoire...

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.420
How will you use it, I wonder.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.630
Go on.

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:19.220
And move forward, Ragna.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.410
I'm so hungry...

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.160
Let go.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.630
You ignored me...

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.210
You ended up ignoring me...

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.720
Curse you to Hell. I hope you get a paper cut.

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.300
You little twerp...

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.340
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:04.560
this man is a despicable villain who will leave starving children to die on the street!

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.770
He's a cold-hearted monster.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:06.940
He's the devil himself—

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.810
Shut your pie hole already! You're making a scene.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:13.150
So you'll treat me? To. A. Meal?

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:28.040
Sorry for the belated introduction. My name is Sena.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.960
Nice to meet you, Mr. Ragna the Bloodedge.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.340
So you do know who I am.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:38.420
I can sense two auras within you. Who's your friend?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.470
I was lied to when they told me you had the understanding of an oaf.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.520
Luna, come say hi.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.480
Moron!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.440
Huh?!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.270
Dumbass, scumbag, pervert!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:56.400
If you weren't a friend of Master Jubei's, your ass would be grass by now!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.990
Jubei? You're—

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.660
You pedophile! Ragna the Pedoedge!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.740
Who're you callin' a pedophile?!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.080
Don't ignore me!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:12.920
Is that a Nox Nyctores?

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:14.420
Huh?

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:26.760
Nice to meet you, as they say.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:30.140
My name is Platinum the Trinity.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:31.390
Trinity...

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.860
One of the Six Heroes?

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.070
You well deserve your reputation if you noticed me.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.320
Fine words, coming from you.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.740
You had no intention of hiding yourself.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:44.950
What do you want from me?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.500
I understand your wariness.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.620
But I have no intention of fighting you.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.750
Ragna, there is something I wish to tell you.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:01.510
You must not fight Yuuki Terumi.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:06.550
With your Azure Grimoire,
you stand no chance against him.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.770
Huh?! The hell are you talking about?

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.560
What the...

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.110
I'm stuffed!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:25.990
Later, dude.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.990
Thank you for the meal.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.370
What's with those three?

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:43.880
That's...

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.550
Tager speaking. Kokonoe, do you read me?

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.220
There's more static than hairs
on my tail, but I can hear you.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.060
What is it?

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.520
I was tracking some Azure particulates, but I drew the short straw.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.610
So it's Ragna the Bloodedge we find first.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.730
I have no confirmed sightings of Noel Vermillion.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.280
What do you want to do.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:05.110
Well, ain't this interesting?

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.070
Kokonoe?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.990
Stay were you are, Tager.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.740
Let's go for a preliminary skirmish.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.000
Preliminary skirmish? What are you—

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.290
I'm sending it over, Tager!

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.930
Spacial transfer complete.

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.720
Activating... Activating... Activating...

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:03.610
Um, the title for episode six is...

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:04.440
Episode Styx?!

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:06.480
Styx?! I'm too beautiful to die!

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:07.690
...False World.

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:08.820
False whorled?

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:10.410
I'm getting dizzy.
